    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup before publishing\n1. Create an n8n variable named BACKEND_BASE_URL with the public HTTPS backend origin.\n2. Create one Header Auth credential: Name = Authorization, Value = Bearer followed by the same N8N_SHARED_SECRET stored in the backend.\n3. Assign that credential to the Immediate Event webhook and all five HTTP Request nodes.\n4. Copy the Immediate Event production URL into the backend variable N8N_INBOUND_WEBHOOK_URL.\n5. Publish the workflow. The one-minute branch recovers events if the immediate notification fails.",
        "height": 360,
